</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\" fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" symmetric=\"true\"></mo></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nLet's add it to the phase space:</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-f320c07c5dd3e34006e8c51d5639df8c\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/f320c07c5dd3e34006e8c51d5639df8c\"></div>\n\n<p>The phase portrait of our system looks as follows:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-e8ac8526af2a9de126911ae36b4cde9a\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/e8ac8526af2a9de126911ae36b4cde9a\"></div><div class=\"studentAnswerHeader\">Your Answer:</div><div class=\"studentAnswer\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-334628-a-2\"></div></div>",
